and in 3D they are given as:
.PP
8 7 +---------------------+ |\\ |\\ | \\ | \\ | \\ | \\ | \\ | \\ | 5+---------------------+6 | | | | +----|----------------+ | 4\\ | 3 \\ | \\ | \\ | \\ | \\ | | | +---------------------+ 1 2
.PP
.PP
