.SS "\fBp8est_connectivity_shared_t\fP* p8est_connectivity_share (\fBp8est_connectivity_t\fP * conn_in, int root, sc_MPI_Comm comm)"

.PP
Take a connectivity on a single rank and share it with MPI3\&. If MPI shared windows are not found at configure time, this function calls \fBp8est_connectivity_bcast\fP instead and wraps its result in the result\&. The function is collective over the communicator passed\&.
.PP
This function is only well defined for an intranode communicator\&. Before calling it, the input connectivity may be made available on the \fIroot\fP rank using \fBp8est_connectivity_bcast\fP with a surrounding communicator that contains one root process of every node\&.
