.br
\fIcomm\fP When configured with MPI3 enabled, this intranode communicator must permit MPI3 windows\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The new connectivity object stores all data of the input \fIconn\fP in MPI3 shared windows\&. Must be freed by \fBp8est_connectivity_shared_destroy\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

